    "FixedInstrumentQuestions": {
      "type": "array",
      "description": "Fixed instrument. When present the planner is bypassed: every question is stored verbatim (whitespace collapsed), in this order, with exactly this response contract, except that a question sent as qualitative (or as a choice without options) whose own text lists its answers is stored as the choice question that text states: single choice, multiselect or ranking. Use `edits` on the saved revision to set it back to qualitative. Consecutive questions sharing a module label form one module. Cannot be combined with refinement, answers, questionResponses, or suggestQuestionStimuli. Repeated question texts or colliding ids are rejected.",
